REQUIREMENTS IN FORCE:
- item: a watch (store label: casual & fashion watches), quantity 1; requirements: dial glass: sapphire; color family: not multicolor; gender: female
- budget: at most 3950 cents in total
- pick: any listing that fits everything
- in stock only
- rule from the request: If nothing fits, say so; no substitutes or alternatives.
- rule from the request: Send no more than 3 messages to the shopper.
- rule from the request: Use no more than 38 moves or tool calls.
- rule from the request: Only buy items actually available in the shop now.
- if nothing fits: end without naming or suggesting any listing
- listing attributes come from datasheet_for_item; a listing's page (what a chain of pages or a page check means) is shown by view_listing

